'''[[Nicaragua]]''' (officially the '''Republic of Nicaragua''' {{langx|es|República de Nicaragua}} {{IPA|es|reˈpuβlika ðe nikaˈɾaɣwa||República_de_Nicaragua.ogg}}) is a country in [[Central America]], bordering both the [[Caribbean Sea]] and the North [[Pacific Ocean]], between [[Costa Rica]] and [[Honduras]]. Nicaragua is the largest country in Central America in square kilometers.

